  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased LM relevance of the national skills development system as part of the national HRD Strategy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO aims to strengthen the Technical and Vocational Skills Development Commission (TVSDC) in developing and implementing upgraded Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) and Work Based Learning (WBL), besides ensuring the improved capacity of employers of the selected sectors (SSC) in skills needs assessment, WBL and RPL.</narrative>
  </description>
